{"title": "Which 2026 Samsung Galaxy Tab should you buy?", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/23/which-2026-samsung-galaxy-tab-should-you-buy/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/09/galaxy-tab-s11-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Samsung has a huge lineup of Galaxy tablets to choose from right now, and they’re all a little different.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Galaxy Tab S12+ is the Samsung tablet to choose for a premium mix of entertainment, creativity, and productivity. The Galaxy Tab S12 Ultra gives you an even bigger canvas, while the Galaxy Tab S11 brings flagship features to a more portable size. For everyday value, start with the Galaxy Tab S10 FE series or the affordable Galaxy Tab A11+.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Samsung’s tablet lineup covers everything from watching a show on the couch to sketching your next project or getting work done between meetings. The right choice comes down to what you want that extra screen to do.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With options across a wide range of price points, Samsung has a Galaxy tablet for different needs and budgets this holiday season.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/23/which-2026-samsung-galaxy-tab-should-you-buy/#more-738479\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-23T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-24T20:35:39.074522+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
