{"title": "Which Samsung folding phone is right for you? Galaxy Z Fold 8, Ultra, or Flip 8", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/23/samsung-folding-phone-guide/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/07/galaxy-z-fold-8-review-42.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Folding phones are entering a new chapter and, if you’re looking to try one for the first time, you might not know exactly where to start. In this guide, we’ll take a look at some of the most important questions to answer when buying a foldable, and dissect how Samsung’s Galaxy Z Fold 8, Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra, and Galaxy Z Flip 8 fit the bill to figure out which is the best for you, especially if you’re interested in one this holiday season.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/23/samsung-folding-phone-guide/#more-734590\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-23T04:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-24T20:35:39.074522+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
